  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "注意"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 1. "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "suggest"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 作“暗示”解时，宾语从句不用虚拟语气。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "His expression "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "suggested"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that he was angry. 他的表情暗示他生气了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Good weather "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "suggests"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " better crops. 好天气预示好收成。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2. "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "suggest"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 作“建议”解时，它的宾语要用动名词，宾语从句要用虚拟语气。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "suggested"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " taking her out to dinner. 他建议带她到外面去吃饭。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "suggested"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that the work (should) be started at once. 他建议立即动工。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3. "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "suggest"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 作“建议”解时，它的名词是 suggestion，用法和动词相同，它引出的同位语从句和表语从句都要用虚拟语气。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "My "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "suggestion"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " is that we (should) go to attend the meeting. 我的建议是我们应该去参加会议。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
